  "id": 1114,
  "description": "## Calmshore\nCalmshore is a casual, non-competitive guild with no strict contribution requirements.\n\nWe accept players who enjoy relaxed incremental gameplay and want access to basic guild activities and mechanics (raid, challenge, repair maintenance, energizing Pools bonus) without pressure.  \n\nWe expect members to participate or contribute at their own pace — every little bit helps.\n\nJoining Requirement: Combat Lv. 50\n\nDue to prolonged non-participation from past members, members are now required to participate in any guild activity at least once every 3 weeks.\n\nKick: After 4 days of profile inactivity or 3 weeks of guild inactivity.\nYou will be sent a final notice before being kicked.\n\nRaid: Daily x2 - schedule two hours before raid.  \nSkybound Eden (Combat Lv. 70) (55 Minutes) - Floating Gardens of Aetheria\n\n1st Raid: PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, UTC 1am, AWST 9am  \n2nd Raid: PST 7am, CST 9am, EST 10am, UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nWeekly Energizing Pools activated on SAT and SUN (America) after 1st raid.\n\n(Saturday) PST 6:55pm, CST 8:55pm, EST 9:55pm, (Sunday) UTC 1:55am, AWST 9:55am  \n(Sunday) PST 6:55pm, CST 8:55pm, EST 9:55pm, (Monday) UTC 1:55am, AWST 9:55am\n\nOur Discord: https://discord.gg/Np2jQR4BCz\n\nCurrent Goal:  \nComplete Guild Challenges to afford weekly Guild Raids &amp; Energizing Pools  \nMaintain Repair Material in Stockpile\n\nHistory:  \n20251212 Guild Established, transferred from &#039;Harem Kings&#039; Guild  \n20260403 Completion of Energizing Pools\n\n### | GUILD BOARD |\n\n[GUILD MARKS]  \nEach completed Guild Challenge add 1 mark. Guild Marks are used to fund Raids (3 marks per raid) and Energizing Pools (5 marks per activation).\n\n[CONTRIBUTION]  \nContribute at your own pace.  \n- Join a raid. (Lv. 70 raid rewards 2.1k gold, 23k Combat EXP, 25k Guild Mastery EXP)\n- Contribute to Guild Challenge. We appreciate all the help we can get.\n- Repair Material Stockpile. Best to repair guild components as soon as possible - repair cost increases with the degree of deterioration.\n\n[Repair Material Stockpile]  \nGuild components are best repair at near 80%\n\nMission Table (Stockpile quantity on 06 July 26)  \n754 Oak Log (7233)  \n754 Birch Log (19889)  \n754 Banyan Log (27511)  \n1,006 Willow Log (9912)  \n754 Mahogany Log (20000)  \n754 Lead Bar (2345)  \n754 Steel Bar (3924)  \nRepair Stock: 3 times\n\nEnergizing Pools  \n2,500 Spruce Log (9431)  \n2,500 Maple Log (29733)  \n1,500 Mystical Log (20000)  \n1,500 Iron Bar (3115)  \n1,500 Mercury Bar (6635)  \n1,500 Uranium Bar (2456)  \nRepair Stock: 2 times\n\n### | Posted on 20260624 |\n\nHeya, New update just drop! Hope everybody have started your own village, probably the most idle feature of IdleMMO. XD\n\nThis Saturday, we will be moving our Guild Raid to Celestial Observatory.\n\nOrbit of the Forgotton (Combat Lv.80) (60 minutes) - Celestial Observatory\n\n(Saturday) PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, (Sunday) UTC 1am, AWST 9am\n\nI will make another announcement to mark the switch after the last raid in Floating Garden of Aetheria ended.\n\n### | Posted on 20260629 |\nSorry for the confusion and inconveniences.\n\nWe are returning our raid to:\n\nSkybound Eden (Combat Lv. 70) (55 Minutes) - Floating Gardens of Aetheria\n\nOne of our member request to extend it. For Lv80 Raid, we&#039;ll wait until no one request to stay on Lv. 70 Raid before moving on.\n\nNew member, Elruna! Welcome!\n\nLast week Contributors:\nWrenidall, Minutiae, Prosektikos, Radiumgirl, zerokai, ShadowVoid, Owaeka, Przebiegly, p00pspanker, PlushieWarrior, DreadChaos\n\nDepositors: \nzerokai, G333\n\n### | Posted on 20260706 |\nNew member, MeanMike! Welcome!\n\nLast week Contributors:\nWrenidall, Prosektikos, zerokai, Owaeka, Minutiae, ShadowVoid, P00pspanker, MeanMike, Przebiegly, Yaalt, G333\n\nDepositors: \nzerokai, Elruna, Wrenidall",
